{
  "id": "quadrature-conditioning",
  "title": {
    "ja": "求積：狭いピーク・相殺・端点・誤差推定の盲点",
    "en": "Quadrature: narrow peaks, cancellation, endpoints and estimator blind spots"
  },
  "method_ids": [
    "quadrature"
  ],
  "summary": {
    "ja": "Gauss次数と適応公差を走査し、狭いLorentzピーク、平方根端点、巨大な相殺、零積分、見逃すcompact bumpを解析積分とQUADPACKで検証します。",
    "en": "Vary Gauss order and adaptive tolerance on narrow Lorentz peaks, a square-root endpoint, severe cancellation, a zero integral and a deliberately missed compact bump, using analytic integrals and QUADPACK."
  },
  "assumptions": {
    "ja": "区間[0,1]、Gauss次数8/16/32/64/128、公差10⁻⁵/10⁻⁷/10⁻⁹です。Lorentz幅.1/.03/.01、相殺係数0/2¹²/2²⁴/2³⁶を固定します。零積分の相対条件数は未定義としてnullで保存します。",
    "en": "Use[0,1], Gauss orders8/16/32/64/128 and tolerances10⁻⁵/10⁻⁷/10⁻⁹. Lorentz widths are.1/.03/.01; cancellation scales are0/2¹²/2²⁴/2³⁶. A zero integral has undefined relative condition, stored as null."
  },
  "algorithm": {
    "ja": "Golub–Welschの節点・重みと、局所差/15を用いる適応Simpsonを実装します。端点ではx=t²変換を別対照とし、狭いbumpには既知支持区間を分割した対照を用意します。これは一般的な自動救済機構ではありません。",
    "en": "Implement Golub–Welsch nodes/weights and adaptive Simpson with a local difference/15 estimate. Companion checks use x=t² for the endpoint and a known-support split for the narrow bump; these are not general automatic rescue mechanisms."
  },
  "validation": {
    "ja": "roots_legendre、解析atan積分、2/3、bumpの256w/315、独立QUADPACKを比較します。QUADPACKの状態・推定誤差・評価回数・警告文も保存します。相殺はε_machine×積分絶対量に対応する絶対予算を使います。初期5点が全て零のbumpでは推定誤差0と実誤差約.00813を明示します。",
    "en": "Compare roots_legendre, analytic atan integrals,2/3,the bump integral256w/315 and independent QUADPACK. Preserve QUADPACK status, estimated error, evaluation count and warning message. Cancellation uses a roundoff-aware absolute budget. When all initial five bump samples vanish, expose estimated error0 versus actual error about.00813."
  },
  "limits": {
    "ja": "Simpsonの推定値は厳密誤差上界ではありません。盲点の検出に合格しても積分精度への合格ではありません。平方根の直接積分は深さ予算で未収束と表示し得ます。任意の振動・特異性の完全な探索や認証付き求積は主張しません。",
    "en": "The Simpson estimate is not a certified error bound. Passing the blind-spot control does not mean accurate integration. Direct square-root integration may honestly terminate at its depth budget. Exhaustive oscillatory/singular exploration and certified quadrature are not claimed."
  },
