      "review_level": "primary author paper, abstract and selected introduction/error-estimation text (§3)",
      "review": {
        "ja": "二つの近似積分値の差が偶然小さい場合の誤差推定失敗を原文の選択節で確認しました。今回のSimpson対照は教材独自の構成であり、同論文の新積分器を実装したとは呼びません。",
        "en": "Checked selected original discussion of accidentally small differences between quadrature estimates. The educational Simpson counterexample is original test design, not an implementation of the paper’s new integrators."
      }
